# Allowlist: the image gets the code and its dependency list, nothing else.
# Exclusions like `.env` only match at the context root; an allowlist also
# keeps nested .env files, indexes and private eval files out of image layers.
*
!src/
!requirements.txt

# Belt and braces inside the allowed folders.
**/__pycache__
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite*
